@baseUrl = http://localhost:5214
# After login, copy token from the response into the variable below (never commit a real token).
@token = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_TOKEN

### Register student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"pilot-student","fullName":"Pilot Student","email":"pilot@example.com","password":"Choose-a-new-password"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"pilot-student","password":"Choose-a-new-password"}

### Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exercises
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/practice/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### History and quota
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/practice/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (revokes token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Must be 401 without authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
